@title INC-3107 DNS misconfiguration
@subtitle Network team, Alder Cloud Games
@date 2026-08-19

kpi Duration | 1 h 52 min
kpi Lowest success rate | 61.3%
kpi Matches failed | 48,200
kpi Region | EU-West

## What happened

A Terraform change replaced the weighted DNS records for match.eu with a single record pointing at a decommissioned load balancer. Negative caching with a TTL of 3600 seconds kept failures going after the record was fixed.

## Timeline

table = Time (UTC),Event; 09:12,Terraform apply; 09:15,success rate drops; 09:31,player reports spike on social media; 09:40,incident declared; 10:05,bad record identified; 10:11,record restored; 11:04,success rate back above 99% and incident resolved

